+/*
+ * -progressurl <url>: HTTP PUTs to <url>/stream?..., <url>/streamDetail?... (each input stream), <url>?duration=...
+ *                     and every stats period <url>?progress=...&size=...&remaining=...&speed=...[&vdec_hw_status=...]
